---
---

<section
	data-testid="process"
	id="process"
	class="flex flex-col items-start justify-center py-20 lg:py-32"
>
	<h2 class="mb-2 font-monospace text-2xl text-orange lg:text-4xl">Design Process</h2>
	<span class="mb-8 h-1 w-10 bg-orange"></span>

	<p class="mb-10 max-w-2xl text-lg text-black dark:text-white leading-relaxed">
		Four iterative phases, each building directly on what we learned.
	</p>

	<div class="mb-14 w-full">
		<img
			src="/images/palup/process_timeline_diagram.png"
			alt="Design process timeline: Research → Sketch → Wireframe → Prototype"
			class="w-full rounded-2xl shadow-lg"
			loading="lazy"
		/>
		<p class="mt-3 text-center text-sm text-black dark:text-white opacity-60">
			Process timeline: Research → Paper Prototype → Wireframes → Medium-Fi → High-Fi
		</p>
	</div>

	<!-- Phase 1 -->
	<div class="mb-20 w-full">
		<div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-4">
			<span class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-orange font-bold text-white">1</span>
			<h3 class="font-monospace text-xl font-bold text-black dark:text-white lg:text-2xl">
				Paper Prototype
			</h3>
		</div>
		<p class="mb-6 max-w-2xl text-base text-black dark:text-white leading-relaxed">
			We sketched four core task flows: managing a profile, finding and joining an event, creating an
			event, and chatting with participants. A cross-team heuristic evaluation surfaced 12 issues.
		</p>

		<div class="mb-4 rounded-xl bg-orange/5 border border-orange/20 p-5 dark:bg-orange/10">
			<p class="mb-2 font-semibold text-orange">Most severe issues found:</p>
			<ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-sm text-black dark:text-white space-y-1">
				<li>No send button visible in the chat interface</li>
				<li>No way to leave a chatroom</li>
				<li>Event creation and home browsing shared the same screen — users didn't know which mode they were in</li>
			</ul>
		</div>

		<div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
			<figure>
				<img
					src="/images/palup/paper_prototype_before_eval_create_event.jpg"
					alt="Paper prototype — Create Event flow before evaluation"
					class="w-full rounded-xl shadow"
					loading="lazy"
				/>
				<figcaption class="mt-2 text-center text-xs text-black dark:text-white opacity-60">Create Event — before eval</figcaption>
			</figure>
			<figure>
				<img
					src="/images/palup/paper_prototype_before_eval_view_event_chatroom.jpg"
					alt="Paper prototype — Chatroom before evaluation"
					class="w-full rounded-xl shadow"
					loading="lazy"
				/>
				<figcaption class="mt-2 text-center text-xs text-black dark:text-white opacity-60">Chatroom — before eval</figcaption>
			</figure>
			<figure>
				<img
					src="/images/palup/paper_prototype_before_eval_profile.jpg"
					alt="Paper prototype — Profile before evaluation"
					class="w-full rounded-xl shadow"
					loading="lazy"
				/>
				<figcaption class="mt-2 text-center text-xs text-black dark:text-white opacity-60">Profile — before eval</figcaption>
			</figure>
			<figure>
				<img
					src="/images/palup/paper_prototype_after_eval_create_event.jpg"
					alt="Paper prototype — Create Event after evaluation"
					class="w-full rounded-xl shadow"
					loading="lazy"
				/>
				<figcaption class="mt-2 text-center text-xs text-black dark:text-white opacity-60">Create Event — after eval</figcaption>
			</figure>
			<figure>
				<img
					src="/images/palup/paper_prototype_after_eval_chatroom.png"
					alt="Paper prototype — Chatroom after evaluation"
					class="w-full rounded-xl shadow"
					loading="lazy"
				/>
				<figcaption class="mt-2 text-center text-xs text-black dark:text-white opacity-60">Chatroom — after eval</figcaption>
			</figure>
			<figure>
				<img
					src="/images/palup/paper_prototype_after_eval_profile.png"
					alt="Paper prototype — Profile after evaluation"
					class="w-full rounded-xl shadow"
					loading="lazy"
				/>
				<figcaption class="mt-2 text-center text-xs text-black dark:text-white opacity-60">Profile — after eval</figcaption>
			</figure>
		</div>

		<div class="mt-4 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
			<figure>
				<img
					src="/images/palup/paper_prototype_after_eval_join_event_1.jpg"
					alt="Paper prototype — Join Event after evaluation"
					class="w-full rounded-xl shadow"
					loading="lazy"
				/>
				<figcaption class="mt-2 text-center text-xs text-black dark:text-white opacity-60">Join Event — after eval</figcaption>
			</figure>
			<figure>
				<img
					src="/images/palup/paper_prototype_after_eval_setting.png"
					alt="Paper prototype — Settings after evaluation"
					class="w-full rounded-xl shadow"
					loading="lazy"
				/>
				<figcaption class="mt-2 text-center text-xs text-black dark:text-white opacity-60">Settings — after eval</figcaption>
			</figure>
		</div>
	</div>

	<!-- Phase 2 -->
	<div class="mb-20 w-full">
		<div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-4">
			<span class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-orange font-bold text-white">2</span>
			<h3 class="font-monospace text-xl font-bold text-black dark:text-white lg:text-2xl">
				Wireframes — Low Fidelity
			</h3>
		</div>
		<p class="mb-6 max-w-2xl text-base text-black dark:text-white leading-relaxed">
			We moved into Figma and connected all flows into an interactive prototype, applying fixes from
			the heuristic evaluation.
		</p>

		<div class="mb-4 rounded-xl bg-orange/5 border border-orange/20 p-5 dark:bg-orange/10">
			<p class="mb-2 font-semibold text-orange">Major fixes applied:</p>
			<ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-sm text-black dark:text-white space-y-1">
				<li>Added a floating "+" button as a dedicated event creation trigger</li>
				<li>Added error states to the login flow</li>
				<li>Separated browsing and creating into distinct screens</li>
			</ul>
		</div>

		<div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
			<figure>
				<img
					src="/images/palup/figma_wireframe_screenshot_home.png"
					alt="Figma wireframe — Home screen"
					class="w-full rounded-xl shadow border border-gray-100"
					loading="lazy"
				/>
				<figcaption class="mt-2 text-center text-xs text-black dark:text-white opacity-60">Home screen</figcaption>
			</figure>
			<figure>
				<img
					src="/images/palup/figma_wireframe_screenshot_create_event_preference.png"
					alt="Figma wireframe — Create Event preferences"
					class="w-full rounded-xl shadow border border-gray-100"
					loading="lazy"
				/>
				<figcaption class="mt-2 text-center text-xs text-black dark:text-white opacity-60">Create Event — preferences</figcaption>
			</figure>
			<figure>
				<img
					src="/images/palup/figma_wireframe_screenshot_create_event_preview.png"
					alt="Figma wireframe — Create Event preview"
					class="w-full rounded-xl shadow border border-gray-100"
					loading="lazy"
				/>
				<figcaption class="mt-2 text-center text-xs text-black dark:text-white opacity-60">Create Event — preview</figcaption>
			</figure>
			<figure>
				<img
					src="/images/palup/figma_wireframe_screenshot_create_event_posted.png"
					alt="Figma wireframe — Event posted confirmation"
					class="w-full rounded-xl shadow border border-gray-100"
					loading="lazy"
				/>
				<figcaption class="mt-2 text-center text-xs text-black dark:text-white opacity-60">Event posted</figcaption>
			</figure>
			<figure>
				<img
					src="/images/palup/figma_wireframe_screenshot_chatroom.png"
					alt="Figma wireframe — Chatroom"
					class="w-full rounded-xl shadow border border-gray-100"
					loading="lazy"
				/>
				<figcaption class="mt-2 text-center text-xs text-black dark:text-white opacity-60">Chatroom</figcaption>
			</figure>
			<figure>
				<img
					src="/images/palup/figma_wireframe_screenshot_login_error.png"
					alt="Figma wireframe — Login error state"
					class="w-full rounded-xl shadow border border-gray-100"
					loading="lazy"
				/>
				<figcaption class="mt-2 text-center text-xs text-black dark:text-white opacity-60">Login error state</figcaption>
			</figure>
		</div>

		<div class="mt-4 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
			<figure>
				<img
					src="/images/palup/first_round_heuristic_eval_chatroom.png"
					alt="First round heuristic evaluation — Chatroom issues"
					class="w-full rounded-xl shadow"
					loading="lazy"
				/>
				<figcaption class="mt-2 text-center text-xs text-black dark:text-white opacity-60">Heuristic eval — chatroom issues</figcaption>
			</figure>
			<figure>
				<img
					src="/images/palup/first_round_heuristic_eval_create_event_profile.jpg"
					alt="First round heuristic evaluation — Create Event & Profile issues"
					class="w-full rounded-xl shadow"
					loading="lazy"
				/>
				<figcaption class="mt-2 text-center text-xs text-black dark:text-white opacity-60">Heuristic eval — create event &amp; profile</figcaption>
			</figure>
		</div>
	</div>

	<!-- Phase 3 -->
	<div class="mb-20 w-full">
		<div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-4">
			<span class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-orange font-bold text-white">3</span>
			<h3 class="font-monospace text-xl font-bold text-black dark:text-white lg:text-2xl">
				Medium-Fidelity Prototype
			</h3>
		</div>
		<p class="mb-6 max-w-2xl text-base text-black dark:text-white leading-relaxed">
			User testing with 4–5 participants revealed two persistent issues in the Create Event flow.
		</p>

		<div class="mb-6 rounded-xl bg-orange/5 border border-orange/20 p-5 dark:bg-orange/10">
			<p class="mb-2 font-semibold text-orange">Issues found &amp; fixes applied:</p>
			<ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-sm text-black dark:text-white space-y-1">
				<li>Newly posted events on the Home screen weren't tappable → <strong>all event cards made tappable across every screen</strong></li>
				<li>The "Vibe" label confused participants → <strong>renamed to "Dining Atmosphere"</strong> (Quiet Meal / Casual Hangout / Deep Conversation)</li>
			</ul>
		</div>

		<div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
			<figure>
				<img
					src="/images/palup/medium_fi_create_event_preferences.png"
					alt="Medium-fi — Create Event preferences screen"
					class="w-full rounded-xl shadow border border-gray-100"
					loading="lazy"
				/>
				<figcaption class="mt-2 text-center text-xs text-black dark:text-white opacity-60">Create Event — preferences</figcaption>
			</figure>
			<figure>
				<img
					src="/images/palup/medium_fi_tappable_card.png"
					alt="Medium-fi — Tappable event card"
					class="w-full rounded-xl shadow border border-gray-100"
					loading="lazy"
				/>
				<figcaption class="mt-2 text-center text-xs text-black dark:text-white opacity-60">Tappable event card</figcaption>
			</figure>
		</div>
	</div>

	<!-- Phase 4 -->
	<div class="mb-4 w-full">
		<div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-4">
			<span class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-orange font-bold text-white">4</span>
			<h3 class="font-monospace text-xl font-bold text-black dark:text-white lg:text-2xl">
				High-Fidelity Prototype
			</h3>
		</div>
		<p class="mb-6 max-w-2xl text-base text-black dark:text-white leading-relaxed">
			A second round of user testing and expert critique pushed the design further.
		</p>

		<div class="mb-8 overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-orange/20">
			<table class="w-full text-sm text-black dark:text-white">
				<thead>
					<tr class="bg-orange/10">
						<th class="px-4 py-3 text-left font-semibold text-orange">Issue Found</th>
						<th class="px-4 py-3 text-left font-semibold text-orange">Fix Applied</th>
					</tr>
				</thead>
				<tbody>
					<tr class="border-t border-orange/10">
						<td class="px-4 py-3">"Budget" vs. total cost ambiguity</td>
						<td class="px-4 py-3">Renamed to <strong>Budget/Person</strong></td>
					</tr>
					<tr class="border-t border-orange/10">
						<td class="px-4 py-3">Group size unclear if creator counted</td>
						<td class="px-4 py-3">Added hint: <em>incl. yourself</em></td>
					</tr>
					<tr class="border-t border-orange/10">
						<td class="px-4 py-3">Cancel/Edit only accessible from My Events</td>
						<td class="px-4 py-3">Added buttons directly on event detail page</td>
					</tr>
					<tr class="border-t border-orange/10">
						<td class="px-4 py-3">Chat input field below keyboard</td>
						<td class="px-4 py-3">Repositioned above keyboard (standard mobile pattern)</td>
					</tr>
					<tr class="border-t border-orange/10">
						<td class="px-4 py-3">Mute toggle had no visible feedback</td>
						<td class="px-4 py-3">Replaced with <strong>pinned notice</strong> at top of chatroom</td>
					</tr>
					<tr class="border-t border-orange/10">
						<td class="px-4 py-3">Report reason locked after selection</td>
						<td class="px-4 py-3">Made reason editable before submission</td>
					</tr>
				</tbody>
			</table>
		</div>

		<div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
			<figure>
				<img
					src="/images/palup/high_fi_homescreen.png"
					alt="High-fi — Home screen"
					class="w-full rounded-xl shadow border border-gray-100"
					loading="lazy"
				/>
				<figcaption class="mt-2 text-center text-xs text-black dark:text-white opacity-60">Home screen</figcaption>
			</figure>
			<figure>
				<img
					src="/images/palup/high_fi_create_event_details.png"
					alt="High-fi — Create Event details"
					class="w-full rounded-xl shadow border border-gray-100"
					loading="lazy"
				/>
				<figcaption class="mt-2 text-center text-xs text-black dark:text-white opacity-60">Create Event — details</figcaption>
			</figure>
			<figure>
				<img
					src="/images/palup/high_fi_create_event_preference_page.png"
					alt="High-fi — Create Event preference page"
					class="w-full rounded-xl shadow border border-gray-100"
					loading="lazy"
				/>
				<figcaption class="mt-2 text-center text-xs text-black dark:text-white opacity-60">Create Event — preferences</figcaption>
			</figure>
			<figure>
				<img
					src="/images/palup/high_fi_create_event_preview.png"
					alt="High-fi — Create Event preview"
					class="w-full rounded-xl shadow border border-gray-100"
					loading="lazy"
				/>
				<figcaption class="mt-2 text-center text-xs text-black dark:text-white opacity-60">Create Event — preview</figcaption>
			</figure>
			<figure>
				<img
					src="/images/palup/high_fi_create_event_posted.png"
					alt="High-fi — Event posted confirmation"
					class="w-full rounded-xl shadow border border-gray-100"
					loading="lazy"
				/>
				<figcaption class="mt-2 text-center text-xs text-black dark:text-white opacity-60">Event posted</figcaption>
			</figure>
			<figure>
				<img
					src="/images/palup/high_fi_my_events.png"
					alt="High-fi — My Events page"
					class="w-full rounded-xl shadow border border-gray-100"
					loading="lazy"
				/>
				<figcaption class="mt-2 text-center text-xs text-black dark:text-white opacity-60">My Events</figcaption>
			</figure>
			<figure>
				<img
					src="/images/palup/high_fi_chatroom.png"
					alt="High-fi — Chatroom"
					class="w-full rounded-xl shadow border border-gray-100"
					loading="lazy"
				/>
				<figcaption class="mt-2 text-center text-xs text-black dark:text-white opacity-60">Chatroom</figcaption>
			</figure>
			<figure>
				<img
					src="/images/palup/high_fi_chatroom_pinned_notice.png"
					alt="High-fi — Chatroom with pinned notice"
					class="w-full rounded-xl shadow border border-gray-100"
					loading="lazy"
				/>
				<figcaption class="mt-2 text-center text-xs text-black dark:text-white opacity-60">Chatroom — pinned notice</figcaption>
			</figure>
			<figure>
				<img
					src="/images/palup/high_fi_profile_1.png"
					alt="High-fi — Profile page"
					class="w-full rounded-xl shadow border border-gray-100"
					loading="lazy"
				/>
				<figcaption class="mt-2 text-center text-xs text-black dark:text-white opacity-60">Profile</figcaption>
			</figure>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
